<title>JAPAN: TIFFE euroyen ends flat as JGBs come off lows.</title>
<headline>TIFFE euroyen ends flat as JGBs come off lows.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>April 30 settlement  prev settlement</p>
<p> TIFFE Euroyen 3M (Z)     98.98		   98.98</p>
<p>---------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>Key December three-month euroyen deposit rate futures ended Wednesday's TIFFE day session flat, as Japanese government bond (JGB) futures pared part of their losses by the close, traders said.</p>
<p>The key contract settled at 98.98 after trading between 98.95 and 99.00. Day session turnover was 52,152 lots.</p>
<p>&quot;The December erased losses by the end of the day as JGB futures closed off their lows,&quot; said a brokerage house trader.</p>
</text>
